{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794808260190,"sessionID":"ses_e1d1c612bffenqRaMYnBfMfTGv","part":{"partID":"prt_1e2e8a147002Q38Ka11WcpUTlF","sessionID":"ses_e1d1c612bffenqRaMYnBfMfTGv","messageID":"msg_1e2e893c6001ilTMpLty3dVA0u","type":"tool","id":"call_00_lcwdwbt71cs3h7bs9a9qvv5k","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/422-opencode-pi-handover-parity && L=specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek && node -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\");const l=process.argv[1];\nconst lines=fs.readFileSync(l+\"/deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"utf8\").split(\"\\n\").filter(Boolean).map(x=>JSON.parse(x));\nconsole.log(\"records:\",lines.length);\nconsole.log(lines.map(r=>[r.type,r.iteration??\"-\",r.status??\"-\",r.event??r.stem??\"-\"].join(\" | \")).join(\"\\n\"));\n' \"$L\"; echo \"=== strategy questions ===\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' \"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\" | head -20"},"output":"records: 2\nconfig | - | - | -\niteration | 1 | complete | -\n=== strategy questions ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] What does each runtime's prepare text tell the sender about keeping details out of the note, and does it over-promise what a fresh session can recover through the History Lookup?\n- [x] What claim text and History Lookup offer does the receiver read on OpenCode versus Pi, and what makes a receiver leave a claim unverified instead of running the lookup?\n- [ ] How do the OpenCode and Pi session readers feed the History Lookup, including their tool-call argument shapes and secret redaction, and what does each fail to recover?\n- [ ] Does model and effort carry on relaunch for each runtime, and where can it silently degrade or be dropped?\n- [ ] Which known limits (OpenCode store without a directory column, AI_SESSION_CHILD leaking into test sandboxes, the 160-character preview cut, a double nudge from two hooks) cause a hop to fail, and what concrete fix addresses each?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Implementing the fixes. This run reports findings and concrete fix proposals only.\n- Re-scoring the live Pi/OpenCode runs in `scratch/runs/`; their scorecards are evidence, not targets.\n- Auditing unrelated hook subsystems (git, spec-gate, skill-advisor) except where they change hand-over behaviour.\n\n---\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"records: 2\nconfig | - | - | -\niteration | 1 | complete | -\n=== strategy questions ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] What does each runtime's prepare text tell the sender about keeping details out of the note, and does it over-promise what a fresh session can recover through the History Lookup?\n- [x] What claim text and History Lookup offer does the receiver read on OpenCode versus Pi, and what makes a receiver leave a claim unverified instead of running the lookup?\n- [ ] How do the OpenCode and Pi session readers feed the History Lookup, including their tool-call argument shapes and secret redaction, and what does each fail to recover?\n- [ ] Does model and effort carry on relaunch for each runtime, and where can it silently degrade or be dropped?\n- [ ] Which known limits (OpenCode store without a directory column, AI_SESSION_CHILD leaking into test sandboxes, the 160-character preview cut, a double nudge from two hooks) cause a hop to fail, and what concrete fix addresses each?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Implementing the fixes. This run reports findings and concrete fix proposals only.\n- Re-scoring the live Pi/OpenCode runs in `scratch/runs/`; their scorecards are evidence, not targets.\n- Auditing unrelated hook subsystems (git, spec-gate, skill-advisor) except where they change hand-over behaviour.\n\n---\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/422-opencode-pi-handover-parity && L=specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek && node -e '\\nconst fs=require(\\\"fs\\\");const l=process.argv[1];\\nconst lines=fs.readFileSync(l+\\\"/deep-research-state.jsonl\\\",\\\"utf8\\\").split(\\\"\\\\n\\\").filter(Boolean).map(x=>JSON.parse(x));\\nconsole.log(\\\"records:\\\",lines.length);\\nconsole.log(lines.map(r=>[r.type,r.iteration??\\\"-\\\",r.status??\\\"-\\\",r.event??r.stem??\\\"-\\\"].join(\\\" | \\\")).join(\\\"\\\\n\\\"));\\n' \\\"$L\\\"; echo \\\"=== strategy questions ===\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' \\\"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\\\" | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794808258887,"end":1794808260190}}}}
