l, and what concrete fix addresses each?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How do the OpenCode and Pi session readers feed the History Lookup, including their tool-call argument shapes and secret redaction, and what does each fail to recover?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Redaction drops tool-call secrets in a shape-dependent way\",\"The Pi reader enumerates the store and can pick the wrong session\"],\"focusTrack\":\"session-readers\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/project.mjs:40\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/opencode.mjs:256\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs:222\",\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs:127\",\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/history/lib/cli.ts:406\",\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/history/lib/core.ts:56\",\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/history/lib/navigator.ts:265\",\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/history/lib/navigator.ts:284\",\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/history/lib/lookup-offer.ts:85\",\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/runs/base1-pi/meta.json\"],\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-readers\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"What do the OpenCode and Pi readers fail to recover?\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-args-coerced\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Non-object tool-call arguments become an empty object\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-no-directory-column\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"An OpenCode store without a directory column cannot prove the session folder\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-projection-store-unreadable\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"A tool-result pairing defect is reported as store_unreadable\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-preview-160-below-sideword\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"The browse preview cuts 135 characters before the live side word\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-i