m of one already started.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/lib/nudge.cjs:389\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"The child flag suppresses only the claim\",\"reason\":\"The nudge is the suppressed path and the claim path has no check at all.\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"The harness's unset list is a general environment sanitizer\",\"reason\":\"It names four specific variables plus a Vibe key, so every other inherited flag passes through.\",\"iteration\":4}\n","path":"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":4,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"The AI_SESSION_CHILD leak into launched senders and receivers\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":5,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All 5 findings are new: the flag is the first gate in the nudge decision, the wrapper and harness both leave it in place, and the claim path is the asymmetric survivor.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does each runtime's prepare text tell the sender about keeping details out of the note, and does it over-promise what a fresh session can recover through the History Lookup?\\\",\\\"What claim text and History Lookup offer does the receiver read on OpenCode versus Pi, and what makes a receiver leave a claim unverified instead of running the lookup?\\\",\\\"How do the OpenCode and Pi session readers feed the History Lookup, including their tool-call argument shapes and secret redaction, and what does each fail to recover?\\\",\\\"Does model and effort carry on relaunch for each runtime, and where can it silently degrade or be dropped?\\\",\\\"Which known limits (OpenCode store without a directory column, AI_SESSION_CHILD leaking into test sandboxes, the 160-character preview cut, a double nudge from two hooks) cause a hop to fail, and what concrete fix addresses each?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"The child flag suppresses only the claim\\\",\\\"The harness's unset list is a general environment sanitizer\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"environment-hygiene\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"ambiguous-input\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/hooks/goal/lib/goal-core.cjs:1191\\\",\\\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/lib/nudge.cjs:704\\\",\\\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/lib/nudge.cjs:389\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/skilled-loop:911\\\",\\\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/harness/live-hop.sh:63\\\",\\\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/runs/base1-pi/relaunch.log:1\\\"],\\\"graphEvent