ITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-25\",\"source\":\"f-three-artifacts-agree\",\"target\":\"src-run-pane-pi\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-26\",\"source\":\"f-three-artifacts-agree\",\"target\":\"src-session-pi-receiver\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-27\",\"source\":\"f-two-inferences\",\"target\":\"src-readers-pi\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-28\",\"source\":\"f-two-inferences\",\"target\":\"src-oc-plugin\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-29\",\"source\":\"f-core-redaction\",\"target\":\"src-core-redact\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-30\",\"source\":\"f-reader-injected\",\"target\":\"src-cli-history\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-01\",\"source\":\"f-note-false-claim\",\"target\":\"q-prepare-text\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-02\",\"source\":\"f-three-artifacts-agree\",\"target\":\"q-claim-offer\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-03\",\"source\":\"f-preview-160-below-sideword\",\"target\":\"q-readers\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-04\",\"source\":\"f-harness-no-scrub\",\"target\":\"q-known-limits\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-05\",\"source\":\"f-no-directory-column\",\"target\":\"q-known-limits\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-06\",\"source\":\"f-preview-160-below-sideword\",\"target\":\"q-known-limits\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-07\",\"source\":\"f-wrapper-no-scrub\",\"target\":\"q-known-limits\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-08\",\"source\":\"f-oc-two-instructions\",\"target\":\"q-known-limits\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-09\",\"source\":\"f-carry-unmeasured\",\"target\":\"q-carry\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"label\":\"The five questions rested on two evidence classes and the guard was right to block: four rest primarily on production source code, and only the claim-offer question rests on the runtime's own recorded state, so a stop justified by code reading alone was a single-lens claim.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:653\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"label\":\"Three independent primary artifacts agree on the 4/5 causal chain: the sender note holds the false cannot-recover instruction, the sender pane shows the reasoning that produced it, and the receiver session store holds the rendered lookup offer plus a reply denying it works.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/runs/base1-pi/note-20261116T053237Z-01a1e2d7-6b7b-75de-a705-ee16233b97a3.md:28\",\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/runs/base1-pi/pane.txt:330\",\"~/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-michelkerkmeester-worktrees-public-422-opencode-pi-handover-parity--/2026-11-16T05-32-58-558Z_01a1e2d8-253d-75b7-978c-e205cabefd81.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-003\",\"label\":\"Two conclusions remain inference rather than observed failure, the Pi cwd keying hazard and the OpenCode two-instruction prompt, and the ledger marks both as secondary-class evidence so synthesis does not overclaim them.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs:222\",\".opencode/plugins/session-handover.js:590\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Source diversity means counting files\",\"reason\":\"The guard counts distinct quality classes, so ten code files remain one class.\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"The blocked stop was a false positive to be argued past\",\"reason\":\"The block described the evidence base accurately.\",\"iteration\":6}\n","path":"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":6,\\\"status\\\":\\\"insight\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Evidence classes and the source ledger for all five answered questions\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":3,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.75,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Two findings are fully new (the source-class guard and the three-artifact agreement) and one is partially new (the two remaining inferences, now labelled); the pass also records a cleaner model of the evidence base, earning the simplicity bonus.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does each runtime's prepare text tell the sender about keeping details out of the 