\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":7,\\\"status\\\":\\\"insight\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Why two questions failed the source-diversity guard and which relation the ledger was missing\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":2,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.75,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"The guard's ANSWERS-only filter is fully new, and the re-filing of two findings is partially new; the pass clarifies the metric without adding external evidence, earning the simplicity bonus.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does each runtime's prepare text tell the sender about keeping details out of the note, and does it over-promise what a fresh session can recover through the History Lookup?\\\",\\\"What claim text and History Lookup offer does the receiver read on OpenCode versus Pi, and what makes a receiver leave a claim unverified instead of running the lookup?\\\",\\\"How do the OpenCode and Pi session readers feed the History Lookup, including their tool-call argument shapes and secret redaction, and what does each fail to recover?\\\",\\\"Does model and effort carry on relaunch for each runtime, and where can it silently degrade or be dropped?\\\",\\\"Which known limits (OpenCode store without a directory column, AI_SESSION_CHILD leaking into test sandboxes, the 160-character preview cut, a double nudge from two hooks) cause a hop to fail, and what concrete fix addresses each?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"The two questions needed a new source\\\",\\\"Counting SUPPORTS edges toward source diversity\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"evidence-coverage\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:339\\\",\\\".skilled/hooks/session-handover/history/lib/navigator.ts:265\\\",\\\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/runs/base1-pi/note-20261116T053237Z-01a1e2d7-6b7b-75de-a705-ee16233b97a3.md:28\\\",\\\"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/scratch/runs/base1-pi/meta.json\\\"],\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-answers-only-filter\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Only ANSWERS edges count toward source diversity\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-ans-10\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-note-false-claim\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-prepare-text\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-ans-11\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-preview-160-below-sideword\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-readers\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-src-31\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-answers-only-filter\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"src-convergence-guard\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"CITES\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Only ANSWERS edges count toward source diversity: buildAnsweringFindingsByQuestion skips every other relation, so the Pi note and pane recorded as SUPPORTS in iteration 6 never entered the prepare-text class count despite being cited.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:339\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Both blocked questions had their primary evidence filed one relation too weak: the Pi note and pane answer what the prepare text failed to teach, and the 295-versus-160 offset answers what browse fails to return, so record