{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794808888689,"sessionID":"ses_e1d1c612bffenqRaMYnBfMfTGv","part":{"partID":"prt_1e2f22cf2002G6h0GJaFNUeqSt","sessionID":"ses_e1d1c612bffenqRaMYnBfMfTGv","messageID":"msg_1e2f22270001EabsfJlFhC0JhF","type":"tool","id":"call_00_jk2zrfxy5a6unw04g4bmjmap","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":8,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":8,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"The two-answering-findings rule behind question coverage and the diversity mean\",\"findingsCount\":2,\"newInfoRatio\":0.6,\"noveltyJustification\":\"The two-answer coverage rule is fully new and the diversity-mean consequence is partially new; the pass clarifies both guards and closes the last relation gap.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What does each runtime's prepare text tell the sender about keeping details out of the note, and does it over-promise what a fresh session can recover through the History Lookup?\",\"What claim text and History Lookup offer does the receiver read on OpenCode versus Pi, and what makes a receiver leave a claim unverified instead of running the lookup?\",\"How do the OpenCode and Pi session readers feed the History Lookup, including their tool-call argument shapes and secret redaction, and what does each fail to recover?\",\"Does model and effort carry on relaunch for each runtime, and where can it silently degrade or be dropped?\",\"Which known limits (OpenCode store without a directory column, AI_SESSION_CHILD leaking into test sandboxes, the 160-character preview cut, a double nudge from two hooks) cause a hop to fail, and what concrete fix addresses each?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Supporting evidence counts as coverage\",\"The graph thresholds are miscalibrated for five questions\"],\"focusTrack\":\"evidence-coverage\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:570\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:653\"],\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-two-answer-rule\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Coverage requires two direct answering findings per question\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-12\",\"source\":\"f-offer-printed\",\"target\":\"q-claim-offer\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-13\",\"source\":\"f-note-false-claim\",\"target\":\"q-claim-offer\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-ans-14\",\"source\":\"f-harness-no-scrub\",\"target\":\"q-known-limits\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-src-32\",\"source\":\"f-two-answer-rule\",\"target\":\"src-convergence-guard\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-001\",\"label\":\"A question counts as covered only when at least two findings answer it directly: coverage is the share of question nodes with two or more ANSWERS edges, so one strong answer plus supporting findings still counts as uncovered.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:570\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-002\",\"label\":\"The same relation error depressed the diversity average rather than the evidence base: sourceDiversity is the mean distinct quality classes per question over all question nodes, so a question with no answering finding contributes zero even when its primary artifacts are recorded and cited.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/coverage-graph/coverage-graph-signals.ts:653\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Supporting evidence counts as coverage\",\"reason\":\"The implementation filters to ANSWERS before counting.\",\"iteration\":8}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"The graph thresholds are miscalibrated for five questions\",\"reason\":\"The thresholds are reachable with two direct answers per question, which this evidence base supports.\",\"iteration\":8}\n","path":"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-opencode-go-deepseek-1794807924469-5jb1x3\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":8,\\\"status\\\":\\\"insight\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"The two-answering-findings rule behind question coverage and the diversity mean\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":2,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.6,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"The two-answer coverage rule is fully new and the diversity