ail:d.reasonDetail,stopReason:d.stopReason,signals:j.graph_signals_json,blockers:j.graph_blockers_json,weighted:d.weightedStopScore,counts:d.inputs?.research?.answeredQuestionSourceCounts},null,1));})'\"}"},"time":{"start":1794808899740,"end":1794808901421}}}}
