{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794809052825,"sessionID":"ses_e1d1c612bffenqRaMYnBfMfTGv","part":{"partID":"prt_1e2f4b56b002ymQkmPB9mn9g3H","sessionID":"ses_e1d1c612bffenqRaMYnBfMfTGv","messageID":"msg_1e2f4a0bb001qN7tCjvIkXROBh","type":"tool","id":"call_00_au1z1ikv6rcu0v8hx7zpu53a","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/research.md","oldString":"## 12. Provenance Note\n\nState was recorded through `append-mode-event.cjs` for every iteration (receipts in `deep-research-audit-ledger` / `deep-research-effect-ledger`), and the reducer refreshed `findings-registry.json`, `deep-research-dashboard.md` and `deep-research-strategy.md` after each one. The coverage graph was persisted inside this lineage (`.coverage-graph/deep-loop-graph.sqlite`) so a detached lineage writes nothing into the shared database.","newString":"## 12. Provenance Note\n\nState was recorded through `append-mode-event.cjs` for every iteration (receipts in `deep-research-audit-ledger` / `deep-research-effect-ledger`), and the reducer refreshed `findings-registry.json`, `deep-research-dashboard.md` and `deep-research-strategy.md` after each one. The coverage graph was persisted inside this lineage (`.coverage-graph/deep-loop-graph.sqlite`) so a detached lineage writes nothing into the shared database.\n\n## 13. Containment Note\n\n- The synthesis step's resource-map command (`reduce-state.cjs --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only`) ignored `--artifact-dir` and wrote `{spec_folder}/research/resource-map.md` in the parent packet. That file did not exist in the lineage's containment baseline, so it was removed to restore the baseline, and `resource-map.md` was generated inside this lineage from the finding deltas instead. A checksum comparison of every baseline file against the live packet reports no change.\n- The continuity save (`generate-context.js`, phase_save) was not run, because it writes canonical spec documents outside this lineage's write surface. Continuity for this run lives in `research.md` and the strategy/dashboard/registry, which the parent merge reads.\n- No git write, stage or checkout was executed."},"output":"Edited specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/research.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/research.md","patch":"Index: specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/research.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/research.md\n+++ specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/session-handover/001-history-lookup-handover-integration/011-opencode-pi-handover-parity/research/lineages/opencode-go-deepseek/research.md\n@@ -199,4 +199,10 @@\n \n ## 12. Provenance Note\n \n State was recorded through `append-mode-event.cjs` for every iteration (receipts in `deep-research-audit-ledger` / `deep-research-effect-ledger`), and the reducer refreshed `findings-registry.json`, `deep-research-dashboard.md` and `deep-research-strategy.md` after each one. The coverage graph was persisted inside this lineage (`.coverage-graph/deep-loop-graph.sqlite`) so a detached lineage writes nothing into the shared database.\n+\n+## 13. Containment Note\n+\n+- The synthesis step's resource-map command (`reduce-state.cjs --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only`) ignored `--arti